00097Er 2               DisPrintOperand:
00097Er 2  0A             asl a                         ; mode * 2 for word table index
00097Fr 2  AA             tax
000980r 2  7C rr rr       jmp (DisOperandJmpTable,x)    ; handler does RTS to our caller
000983r 2               
